# The spoken half hour names the COMING hour: "pusčetri" (half toward
# four) is 03:30 and "pusastoņi" is 07:30 -- hence bare_half_to +
# toward_hour_12h.  Latvian writes the prefix fused onto the hour cardinal, so
# chronologia/extract/numfold_latvian.py splits the word and this file binds the
# prefix it leaves behind.  Source: pronuncia.io, "How to Tell Time and Dates in
# Latvian for English Speakers".
pus
